  "limitations_and_boundaries": [
    "FNO is limited to rectangular domains with uniform grids due to FFT.",
    "Interpolation methods cause large errors for non-linear PDEs on non-uniform meshes.",
    "Geo-FNO requires learning or defining a deformation map, which may be problem-specific.",
    "3D embedding for spherical problems leads to high error due to data and resolution demands.",
    "Plasticity problem requires mesh as target output, so interpolation methods do not apply."
  ],
